Output docs/assets/first-run-config.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1400
Set Height 820
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type "HOME=/tmp/stream-debugger-vhs-home-ux-v4 /tmp/stream-debugger-config-ux" Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "openai"
Tab
Tab
Type "https://api.example.com"
Tab
Type "/v1/stream"
Tab
Tab
Type "region=demo"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+S
Sleep 2s

Type "c"
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
